s Snapshot == nil, instanceView has Freshness: \\\"unknown\\\", Reachable: false, LastObserved prefixed with \\\"attempted \\\", Errors containing the collector error, and instance.html rendering the waiting-title card. Observed: view.go:210 sets \\\"attempted \\\" when Snapshot is nil and LastAttempt is non-zero, but grep shows \\\"attempted\\\" is never asserted in any test file. Required: a regression test in app_test.go for initial instance collection failure. Proposed test-work: add an app/view regression test proving an instance failing its initial collection reports unknown freshness, attempted timestamp, and the waiting card.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"at\": \"2026-09-04T19:26:41.534Z\",\n      \"by\": \"forest-misty-step/canopy\",\n      \"text\": \"took\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"at\": \"2026-09-04T19:29:23.983Z\",\n      \"by\": \"forest-misty-step/canopy\",\n      \"text\": \"ask: Implementation and checks are complete at f93e178 on forest/canopy-tester-initial-collection-failure/first-failure-proof; PR https://github.com/misty-step/canopy/pull/11. Focused regression, all Go tests, and go vet pass. This executive session has no Runner FOREST_RUN_ID, so it cannot publish authorized Builder review-request evidence. An authorized Builder Run must adopt this exact branch, validate/rebase if needed, and publish forest.review-request.v2 for tracker powder. Do not treat the PR or raw branch push as Gate approval or job completion.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"at\": \"2026-09-04T19:31:26.472Z\",\n      \"by\": \"none\",\n      \"text\": \"answer: Executive recovery complete: PR #11 closed and remote forest branch deleted. No review-request evidence was created. Implementation is preserved in the local ref executive/initial-collection-failure-preserved at f93e178. A normal Builder may select this job, inspect/cherry-pick that commit into its own fresh forest branch if useful, rerun checks, and publish through the authorized Runner Gate. Do not treat prior PR or checks