ctor_test.go verifying that: a runner exceeding the configured timeout returns a *CLIError for the timed-out command with \"context deadline exceeded\" and exit -1, passing a canceled parent context halts collection promptly with a command-attributed cancellation error, and nil context returns an error. Observed: collector.go:289-295 sets context.WithTimeout(ctx, c.timeout) and collector.go:139 checks for nil context, but grep shows all existing tests pass timeout 0 and background contexts. Required: unit tests in collector_test.go covering command execution timeout expiration, parent context cancellation, and nil context validation. Proposed test-work: add tests in collector_test.go proving that slow runner commands time out with a command-attributed CLIError and canceled contexts halt collection immediately.' --agent \"${POWDER_AGENT:-tester}\""}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"openrouter","model":"google/gemini-3.8-flash","usage":{"input":4547,"output":624,"cacheRead":107481,"cacheWrite":0,"reasoning":12,"totalTokens":112652,"cost":{"input":0.0043196499999999995,"output":0.002496,"cacheRead":0.01719696,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.02401261}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1788637315639,"responseId":"gen-1788637315-V2KgEaVYac1NNNXu0OYF","rawStopReason":"tool_calls"},{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_271186","toolName":"bash","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"id\": \"canopy-tester-collector-timeout-deadline\",\n  \"title\": \"CLI collector execution timeout and context cancellation attribution lack regression cover\",\n  \"spec\": \"\",\n  \"repo\": \"misty-step/canopy\",\n  \"blocked_by\": [],\n  \"lease\": null,\n  \"ask\": null,\n  \"proof\": null,\n  \"abandoned\": false,\n  \"notes\": [\n    {\n      \"at\": \"2026-09-05T19:42:00.773Z\",\n      \"by\": \"forest-misty-step/canopy\",\n      \"text\": \"filed-by: forest-misty-step/canopy @ misty-step/canopy\\ndeployment: worktree 1788636942913138403-tester (git a1673eb1852c328d955e99c09d2b00